A mem-initializer argument that contains an expansion of an empty pack
nested in a template argument list was itself dropped as an expansion of
the empty pack: the member was value-initialized, and a delegating call
lost an argument and found no constructor.  The MSVC STL's piecewise
std::pair constructor delegates with `index_sequence_for<_Types2...>{}'.
